1 NOTE Parentage established (1 August 2026) from her own 1835 Itaboraí baptism (PAR-0016 → event E-0049): daughter of Manoel de Lemos [Pereira] (P-0052) and Maria Thereza de Jesus (P-0053), the Lemos family of Itaboraí, RJ (family F-0025). The register records only the forename "Roza", so the identity is strong-evidence, not direct — she is the couple's only Roza across the browsed 1832-1838 Itaboraí baptisms, in the parish where her 1879 marriage justification was held (PAR-0002, "em casa do pai de José Antunes de Lemos"), and her brother Candido Pereira de Lemos is named in her husband's 1888 will (PRB-0005). This supersedes the earlier "weakened" doubt (the apparent childbearing gap was an indexing artifact). Born about late 1834 ("nascida a dez mezes").
