1 NOTE LEADS from 2026-08-08 inventário transcript (5-agent deep-read; image verification required before promoting any of these): (a) Two additional possible children of Ladisláo × Mathilde found in partilha precatórias: "Marianna Claudina × Francisco Mendes Ferreira" and "Francisca Amelia × José Mendes Pereira Junior" — would bring the total to 10 children; not yet added as documented_children pending image verification. (b) Aureliano de Sales Toledo appears to have had a second wife: "D. Francisca de Paula Candida" — identified in the transcript; this may explain the conflict between PRB-0009 ("Marciana/Marianna") and PRB-0006 p5b ("Marianna Euphragia, já fallecida") if Marianna Euphragia was the first wife (dead by 1879) and Francisca the second. (c) Narcizo Marques Braz (husband of Carolina Leopoldina Marques, documented_child): b. ~1822, Freq. Santa Marinha, Porto, Portugal; died c. 15 October 1880, Fazenda da Concórdia — from the transcript; image needed. (d) Partition of the Matilde estate was formally closed 3 November 1885.
1 NOTE Parentage tier of P-0061 (Francisco Leocádio) downgraded confirmed → strong-evidence on 2026-08-13 (confidence-tier audit): PRB-0009 lists him as Ladisláo's child, but material conflict #15 (the 1882 embargos transcript reading him as son-in-law, not son) is unresolved, so 'confirmed' — which requires no material unresolved conflict — is not warranted. See STATUS.md conflict #15.
