1 TITL Certified birth certificate of Juan Carlos Muniz Armond
1 TEXT A certified derivative of the subject's Brazilian civil birth registration (10th District of Rio de Janeiro, livro A-350, folha 98, número de ordem 24241) reports his birth at 03:45 on 22 June 1982 in the Hospital Carmela Dutra, Rio de Janeiro; parents Luis Carlos Igracio Armond and Lucinea Aparecida Muniz Armond; and grandparents Geraldo Paz Armond, Cidalia Igracio Armond, Antenor Muniz and Iris Bohrer Muniz. The father was the declarant.
1 REPO @REPO0001@
2 CALN livro A-350, fl. 98, nº 24241 (número de ordem); Talão 300524
