1 TITL Civil birth registration of Eunir Bohrer (child of João Gonçalves Bohrer and Celina Bohrer), Nova Friburgo
1 TEXT The 1924 Nova Friburgo birth registration of Eunir Bohrer, declared by the father João Gonçalves Bohrer (P-0014). The mother, Celina Bohrer (P-0015), is recorded as "natural deste Districto" (born in Nova Friburgo, RJ). It names both grandparent couples — paternal Valentim Martinho Bohrer + Carolina Bohrer, maternal Joaquim José Bohrer + Lucinda Ferreira Bohrer (deceased) — corroborating the parentage of P-0014 and P-0015 and fixing Celina's origin as Nova Friburgo.
