1 TITL Civil death registration (certified extract) of António Ladislão de Toledo, died 11 Feb 1909, Fazenda da Concórdia, Districto de Thebes, Leopoldina MG, naming parents Ladislao Igidio Ferreira de Toledo × Mathilde Luiza de Toledo
1 TEXT Two-page certified extract (certidão) of the civil death registration of António Ladislão de Toledo, recorded as Termo Nº 6, folhas 144–145, Livro de Óbitos 1909, Districto de Thebes, Leopoldina MG. The declarant, José Bernado do Silva Junior (lavrador, local resident), appeared at the cartório on 12 February 1909 with an atestado from Quirino Symphonio de Rezende and Francisco Barboza de Miranda, declaring that the previous evening (11 February 1909 at 9pm) António Toledo had died without medical attendance at Fazenda da Concórdia from a cardiac lesion (lesão cardíaca). He is described as Brazilian, natural of Minas Gerais, cor branca, approximately 70 years of age, widower of Maria Euphronyza de Jesus, and carpinteiro. He is identified as the legitimate son of Ladislao Igidio Ferreira de Toledo and Mathilde Luiza de Toledo (both resident in the district). He left four adult children: Francisco Themotheo de Toledo, José Ladislao de Toledo, Amélia (married to Frederico Augusto Rodrigues), and Mathilde (unmarried). The certidão was issued 4 October 1910 and signed by Luiz G. Fortes de Bustamante, escrivão da paz.
1 REPO @REPO0007@
2 CALN Registro Civil de Óbitos, Districto de Thebes, Leopoldina MG
1 NOTE Evidence classification: civil_registration; derivative; information primary; direct evidence.
