1 TITL Civil death registration of João Bohrer (2001, Volta Redonda), a brother of Iris Bohrer, naming his parents João Gonçalves Bohrer and Celina Bohrer
1 TEXT Informational copy of the civil death registration of João Bohrer, who died 12 January 2001 at the Hospital Evangélico Regional, Volta Redonda (RJ), aged 61 (born c.1940), a retired man natural of Carangola (MG), married to Alice Batista Bohrer. His parents are named as João Gonçalves Bohrer (P-0014) and Celina Bohrer (P-0015), making him a brother of Iris Bohrer (P-0007) — one of the fifteen children of that couple. Recorded as a documented (collateral) sibling on F-0005. The deceased's own record is transcribed in full; only the RG and address of the living declarant (his son-in-law) are withheld, as those identify a living third party.
