1 TEXT A clipping from the Nova Friburgo weekly "A Sentinella" (managed by Capitão Guilherme Samuel Bohrer, a son of Francisco José Bohrer × Rosa Eugenia de Lemos): the 30 Jan 1898 death notice of Manoel Pereira de Lemos, industrialist of Venda das Pedras, who died on 20 Jan 1898 aged 72, expressly "irmão da Exma. Sra. D. Roza Bohrer", i.e. a brother of Rosa Eugenia de Lemos (P-0035). The "gerente desta folha" (Guilherme Samuel Bohrer) is Rosa's son and Manoel's nephew.
