1 TEXT The original 1892 baptism register entry (Igreja de Santo Antônio de Sapucaia, RJ) of Deocleciano Muniz Bittencourt (P-0012): baptized 25 June 1892, born about June 1892, a legitimate son of João Muniz Bittencourt (P-0019) and Susanna (Suzana) Rita Brandão (P-0020). His earliest vital record; it settles the father's given name as "João" (the 1882 provisão's "José" was an error) and upgrades his parentage to confirmed. Godparents João de Souza Freitas and Lina Rita Brandão (corrected from an earlier "Anna" misreading; the image reads "Lina").
