1 TITL Parish baptism transcript of Susanna (Suzana) Rita Brandão (1866, transcribed 1882, Santo Antônio de Sapucaia), naming her parents
1 TEXT The Santo Antônio de Sapucaia (RJ) parish register's 1882 transcript of the 1866 baptism of Susanna (Suzana) Rita Brandão (P-0020): born 20 August 1865, baptized 22 March 1866, filha legítima of José do Rego Brandão (P-0040) and Rita Ignacia de Jesus (P-0041). The godfather Antonio [uncertain: Castro/Caetano] Machado is named as her "avô materno" (maternal grandfather = Rita Ignacia's father). Presented 24 November 1882, the same year as the couple's marriage provision (PAR-0001). Note: the decade reads "sessenta" (1865/1866); a 7 August 2026 edit had wrongly read "setenta" (1875/1876) — impossible against her 1882 marriage (PAR-0001) and her daughter Anna's 1884 birth (PAR-0006). Corrected 11 August 2026 on image re-read.
1 REPO @REPO0014@
2 CALN livro batismos
1 NOTE Evidence classification: parish_register; derivative; information primary; direct evidence.
1 NOTE Transcription: [Paróquia de Santo Antônio de Sapucaia, RJ.] "Aos vinte e quatro dias de Novembro, de mil oito centos e oitenta e dous, nos foi apresentada a certidão seguinte: Aos vinte e dous dias do Março, de mil oito centos e sessenta e seis, o Reverendo João Gonçalves Dias Galvão baptizou solenizmente, a innocente Suzana, nascida a vinte de Agosto de mil oito centos sessenta e cinco; filha legítima, de José do Rego Brandão, e de Rita Ignacia de Jesus; sendo padrinhos, Antonio [uncertain: Castro/Caetano] Machado, avô materno, e Luiza Maria da Conceição. Do que para eu conste, faço este assentamento, que assigino. O Vigario — Lourenço Gomes de Lima."
1 NOTE Archival reference: 1882 register transcript (fl. 111-112) of the 22 March 1866 baptism, Livro de batismos, Paróquia de Santo Antônio de Sapucaia, RJ; the certidão was presented on 24 November 1882 (the year of the couple's marriage provision PAR-0001). Register image via the Familiaridade online gallery, delivered through the research/from-retrieval/ sync; read and promoted 31 July 2026. Dates definitively re-read 11 August 2026 on the image: born "vinte de Agosto de mil oito centos sessenta e cinco" (20 August 1865), baptized "vinte e dous dias do Março de mil oito centos e sessenta e seis" (22 March 1866). This supersedes a 7 August 2026 edit that had wrongly changed the decade "sessenta" to "setenta" (yielding 1875/1876) — chronologically impossible, as she married by provisão in December 1882 (PAR-0001) and bore her daughter Anna on 19 November 1884 (PAR-0006). An even earlier reading had "onze" (11) for the day; the image reads "vinte" (20).
1 NOTE Repository file: evidence/parish/PAR-0005-susanna-rita-brandao-baptism-1866-sapucaia.jpg
