1 TITL Parish death register entry of Ignacia Maria de Jesus (1878, Santo Antônio de Sapucaia), widow of Antonio Caetano Machado
1 TEXT The original 1878 death/burial register entry (Santo Antônio de Sapucaia, RJ) of D. Ignacia Maria de Jesus (P-0046): buried 22 April 1878, widow of Antonio Caetano Machado (P-0045), aged 65 (so born c.1813), cause "degeneração adiposa do coração". A strong candidate for the mother of Rita Ignacia de Jesus (P-0041) — the wife of Antonio Caetano Machado and the source of the "Ignacia" in her daughter's name — and it independently corroborates the "Caetano" reading.
