1 TITL 1821 Barbacena baptism of Carolina, daughter of Ladisláo Egídio Ferreira and Matildes Maria [de Jesus] — placing the couple in Barbacena
1 TEXT The 1821 Barbacena baptism of Carolina, legitimate daughter of Ladisláo Egídio Ferreira (P-0056) and Matildes Maria [de Jesus] (P-0027). It places the couple — Eliza Balbina de Toledo's grandparents — in Barbacena (Piedade da Borda do Campo) in 1821 with a daughter, directly attesting their union and their Barbacena origin. The officiating priests are themselves Ferreira Armonde (the Barbacena Armond clergy), an incidental link between the two Barbacena-rooted lines.
