1 TITL Barbacena marriage of Joaquim José Ferreira de Toledo and Ritta Angélica Rodrigues (c.1786), naming both couples of their parents
1 TEXT The c.1786 Barbacena marriage of Joaquim José Ferreira de Toledo (P-0057) and Ritta Angélica Rodrigues (P-0058). It names both couples of their parents: Joaquim José is son of Gaspar Ferreira and Gertrudes Maria [de Toledo] (of Vila Rica — the apparent origin of the "Ferreira"+"de Toledo" surname), and Ritta is daughter of João Rodrigues [do Valle] and Izabel Ribeira of the Freguesia da Borda do Campo. Joaquim José × Ritta are taken to be the parents of Ladisláo Egídio Ferreira de Toledo (P-0056) — Eliza's grandfather — on strong (not direct) evidence; see F-0028 for the identity reasoning.
