1 TITL 1816 Barbacena marriage of Carolina Francelina de Toledo (daughter of Capitão João José Ferreira de Toledo and Ritta Angélica Rodrigues) to Vicente José da Cunha
1 TEXT The 22 October 1816 Barbacena marriage of Carolina Francelina de Toledo — legitimate daughter of "Capitão João José Ferreira de Toledo" (P-0057) and D. Ritta Angélica Rodrigues (P-0058) — to Vicente José da Cunha (of Ouro Branco). Carolina Francelina is a sister of Ladisláo Egídio Ferreira de Toledo (P-0056); the record independently confirms the apical couple, clearly gives the father as "João José" and adds his militia title Capitão. Not to be confused with Carolina Ferreira de Toledo (b.1821, PAR-0017), Ladisláo × Matilde's daughter (a niece).
