1 TITL Parish marriage of Manoel Muniz Bitancourt and Francisca Roza do Espírito Santo (17 February 1842, Nossa Senhora Mãe de Deus, Povoação, São Miguel)
1 TEXT Marriage on 17 February 1842 at Nossa Senhora Mãe de Deus, Povoação, São Miguel, of Manoel Muniz Bitancourt (P-0042) and Francisca Roza do Espírito Santo (P-0047), dispensed from an impediment of the fourth degree of consanguinity. The act legibly names both parent couples: the groom is son of João Muniz Bitancourt (P-0048) and Maria Eugenia [= Jacintha] de Medeiros (P-0049) — a second primary confirmation of family F-0023 — and the bride is daughter of Manoel de Motta [var. Mello] mancebo (P-0086) and Anna de Souza (P-0087), family F-0042. Witnesses José Jacintho Botelho and Estevão Manoel; officiant Cura José Antonio Barbosa under Vigário Julião Francisco Tavares. CORRECTION: this supersedes the earlier binding of PAR-0024 to folio 73r (a late-1845 marriage of a different "Manoel × Roza de Jesus" couple, groom's father "António"), which was a namesake mis-identification; the true act of this couple is folio 32r (1842).
