1 NOTE Transcription: [Catholic parish baptism register, Grindel, Solothurn. Page 571. Column headers: Date | Parentes | Infantes | Patrini (Godparents). Two entries for the Johannes Wehrli × Barbara Alleman family are transcribed; other entries on the page are omitted.] Row 2 — 17 Januar. 1751: Parents: Gofannef [Johannis] Whroli [Wehrli] / Barbara Allman [Alleman] Infant: Gofannef Jacobif [Johannem Jacobum, i.e. Johann Jacob] Godparents: Hans Jacob Heggendorn / Anna [surname illegible] Row 6 — 23 Junij 1752: Parents: Gofannef [Johannis] Whroli [Wehrli] / Barbara Allman [Alleman] Infant: Gofannef Johef [Johannem Josephum, i.e. Johann Joseph] Godparents: Johef [Josephus] Whroli [Wehrli] / Anna [surname illegible] [Spelling note: "Gofannef" is the German cursive rendering of "Johannis/Johannes" (Gothic J→G, h→f); "Whroli/Alroli" is the cursive rendering of "Wehrli." Row 2 shows "Alroli" which on comparison with Row 6 "Whroli" is the same name in variant scribal spelling. "Allman/Alleman" is the consistent maternal surname.]
