1 TEXT Grindel (Solothurn) Catholic parish marriage register, page 71, entry 4, records the marriage of Jacobus Wehrli [Johann Jacob Wehrli, P-0072] and Elisabetha Borer (P-0073) on 27 January 1782, both described as being from Grindel, Erischwyg (Erschwil). Witnesses were Heinricus Werli (= Henri Wehrli, probably Johann Jacob's brother) and Catharina Borer (possibly Elisabetha's sister or other kin). This is PRIMARY evidence for the marriage of P-0072 × P-0073, upgrading event E-0065 from strong-evidence to confirmed. This source is held in a FamilySearch FHC-restricted collection (ARK 3:1:3Q9M-CSVK-NSXR-C).
