1 TEXT Original Ruivais (Braga, Portugal) baptism entry for João, legitimate son of João Rodrigues [Valle] (P-0080) and Joana Gonçalves (P-0081), born 15 April 1728 and baptized 16 April 1728. This João is João Rodrigues Valle (P-0078), who later emigrated to Minas Gerais and married Isabel Ribeiro at Borda do Campo in 1751 (PAR-0034). Confirms the Portuguese origin corrected in the 1751 marriage certidão and the parent pair matching the 1716 Ruivais marriage (PAR-0036).
