1 TEXT Baptism on 14 August 1831 at Nossa Senhora Mãe de Deus, Povoação, São Miguel, of a legitimate son — his given name is not legibly recoverable from this image — of João [Francisco] Muniz Bitancourt (P-0048) and his wife Maria Jacinta [de Medeiros] (P-0049), family F-0023 — a collateral sibling of the modelled Manoel Muniz Bytancourt (P-0042), another child of the same couple. The boy was born on 1 August 1831. Officiant the Reverendo Vigário Julião Francisco Tavares (the act is also written and signed by the Cura Francisco Muniz Furtado); godparents Manoel José and his wife Victoria de Medeiros (this couple's recurring compadrio); witnesses Manoel Cabral and Francisco Muniz.
