1 TEXT Baptism on 12 October 1834 at Nossa Senhora Mãe de Deus, Povoação, São Miguel, of Rosa, born 4 October 1834, legitimate daughter of João Muniz Betencourt (P-0048) and his wife "Maria Jacinta de Silveiros" (P-0049), family F-0023 — a collateral sibling of the modelled Manoel Muniz Bytancourt (P-0042), another child of the same couple. The mother's surname is written "de Silveiros" here, a scribal variant of the "de Medeiros" of her other records (the repository has documented a recurring parish scribal swap in this mother's name); the father and the recurring godparent couple confirm the identification. Officiant Antonio Jacinto de Arruda; godparents Manoel José da Costa and his wife Victoria de Medeiros (this couple's recurring compadrio); witnesses Antonio José de Medeiros and Bento Pacheco.
