1 TITL Parish baptism of José Muniz (born 23 May 1841, baptized 29 May 1841, Nossa Senhora Mãe de Deus, Povoação, São Miguel) — collateral child of family F-0023
1 TEXT Baptism on 29 May 1841 at Nossa Senhora Mãe de Deus, Povoação, São Miguel, of José, born 23 May 1841, legitimate son of João [Francisco] Muniz Bitancourt (P-0048) and his wife Maria Jacintha [de Medeiros] (P-0049), family F-0023 — a collateral sibling of the modelled Manoel Muniz Bytancourt (P-0042), another child of the same couple. This act confirms that a son named José was born to the couple, born 23 May 1841; whether this José is the later Sapucaia immigrant José remains a separate, unproven hypothesis. Baptized by licence by Ignacio de Souza, Cura of the Ermida de Santa Barbara; godparents Manoel Jo[sé] [da Costa] and his wife Victoria de Medeiros (this couple's recurring compadrio).
1 REPO @REPO0021@
