1 TITL Parish baptism of Maria Muniz Bitancourt (baptised 21 December 1851, born 29 November 1851, Nossa Senhora Mãe de Deus, Povoação, São Miguel), daughter of Manoel Muniz Bitancourt and Francisca Roza do Espírito Santo
1 TEXT Baptism on 21 December 1851 (child born 29 November 1851) at Nossa Senhora Mãe de Deus, Povoação, São Miguel, of Maria, legitimate daughter of Manoel Muniz Bitancourt (P-0042) and Francisca Roza do Espírito Santo (P-0047) — family F-0020 — and therefore a sister of the emigrant João Muniz Bittencourt (P-0019). The entry names both parents and both grandparent couples: paternal grandparents Muniz Bittencourt and Maria Jacintha de Medeiros (the paternal grandfather written here as "José", a scribal variant of João — P-0048 × P-0049, F-0023), and maternal grandparents Manoel de Motta Junior and Anna de Souza (P-0086 × P-0087, F-0042). Godparents: José da [Ponte] and his wife Claudina. Officiants Cura José Antonio Barboza and Cura Joaquim Guilherme da Costa (Cura of Santa Barbara). This is a collateral relative: no person entity is minted for her; she is recorded as a documented child of family F-0020. She is a distinct namesake of her older sister Maria baptised in 1843 (PAR-0045) — two daughters of the same couple share the name.
1 REPO @REPO0021@
2 CALN SMG-PV-MAEDEDEUS-B-1851-1853 (Livro de baptismos, N.S. Mãe de Deus, Povoação, 1851–1853), Culturacores CDN, livro Livro de baptismos SMG-PV-MAEDEDEUS-B-1851-1853 — folio 42 (number visible on the right-hand page); entry headed "Maria", right-hand page of the opening
