1 TITL 1884 Leopoldina petition of Simplício José Ferreira Armond as heir of the late D. Mathilde Maria de Jezus
1 TEXT A petition (12 February 1884, Leopoldina), written and signed by Simplício José Ferreira Armond in his own hand, asking the orphans' judge to complete the long-delayed partition of the estate of the late D. Mathilde Maria de Jezus, who had died about four years earlier (~1880). He petitions as her heir — in right of his wife Eliza Balbina de Toledo (per PRB-0001) — placing Mathilde Maria de Jezus on Eliza's (maternal) line.
