1 TITL Imigrantes de Nova Friburgo — genealogias: BORER I, BORER II, WEHRLI sections (Henrique Bon compiler)
1 TEXT Genealogical compilation for Nova Friburgo Swiss-German immigrant families. Pp.300-301 cover BORER I (Jacob Borer b.1801 Erschwil — Francisco José Bohrer's line) and BORER II (Laurent Borer b.1797 Grindel — Valentim Martinho Bohrer's line). Pp.302-303 cover BORER III (unrelated Johann Borer b.1792 Erschwil line). The Casa Suíça database entries and WEHRLI section document Johann Jacob Wehrli × Elisabetha Borer as the parents of Anna Maria Werhly, Laurent's wife, with primary confirmation of their 1782 Grindel marriage from the Swiss parish register (image rec-bohrer-werly-borer-marriages-grindel-1780.jpg, entry 4, page 71).
1 REPO @REPO0035@
2 CALN Imigrantes de Nova Friburgo — genealogias; Henrique Bon (compiler), livro Pages 300–303 — BORER I (Jacob b.1801 Erschwil) and BORER II (Laurent b.1797 Grindel) genealogy trees; Casa Suíça database entries for Laurent, Vicente, Anna Maria Wehrli, and Johann Jacob Wehrli
1 NOTE Evidence classification: published_genealogy; authored_narrative; information secondary; indirect evidence.
1 NOTE Transcription: [p.300 — BORER (I), Jacob b.1801 Erschwil → Francisco José's line:] "1.1.4. Francisco José Borer — n. 04/07/1832, f. 06/07/1888, causa mortis: insuficiência mitral e dilatação aórtica. ... O casal morava no Alto da Serra." Children listed: Ludovina n.21/07/1862 f.27/12/1862 (infant); Laura n.16/08/1866; Guilherme n.06/04/1868; Fernando n.03/01/1872 cas.06/05/1911 × Julia de Oliveira Cerbino. ⚠ Joaquim José absent from this list (conflict with PRB-0005 will, which names him as firstborn — compiler apparently missed his baptism record). Francisco José's siblings: Catharina n.24/07/1830 f.16/01/1872 (⚭ Frederico Chaboudez); Maria n.21/09/1834 (⚭ Francisco Xavier Chaboudez); Augusto n.10/02/1837; João José n.10/09/1840 f.16/06/1859 (solteiro). Jacob Borer (Patriarca, BORER I) assigned Casa/Lote 70/56 per DB. [pp.300-301 — BORER (II), Laurent b.1797 Grindel → Vicente → Valentim line:] "Laurent Borer, filho de certo Jacob Borer, de Grindel, Soleure, veio aparentemente só para o Brasil … embarcaria ele no Heureux Voyage, ocupando em Nova Friburgo a casa 73 e o lote 86. Nesta vila viria a se casar em 3 de julho de 1820, com Anna Maria Werhly …" Compilation counts "ao menos onze filhos"; Casa Suíça DB narrative gives "doze filhos" — one-child discrepancy noted. Children genealogy tree p.301 (selected): José n.28/03/1821; Anna Maria n.19/06/1822; José Lourenço n.07/07/1823; Anna Maria (2nd) n.03/05/1825; Justina n.06/06/1827; José Joaquim [entry cut off]; Vicente n.06/09/1828 ⚭ 11/04/1864 × Maria Heggendorn (filha de Joseph Heggendorn × Maria (Maria Amélia?) Freese); José Constantino n.08/09/1829; Barbara Elisabeth n.14/12/1830; Regina n.07/07/1832; Maria n.27/12/1834; Thereza n.25/08/1836. Vicente's children: José Domingos n.19/03/1864; Maria Elisabeth n.15/12/1866; Valentim Martinho n.14/11/1868; Vicente n.16/04/1871. Note: José Domingos born ~3 weeks before parents' 11 April 1864 civil marriage. [WEHRLI — Casa Suíça DB entries:] Johann Jacob Wehrli, patriarca, b.17/01/1751 Grindel, Soleure; profession: agricultor; arrived 1819 on Heureux Voyage, Casa/Lote 73/86; married Elisabetha Borer [27 Jan 1782 per Swiss marriage register primary image]; died NF 28/05/1827. Anna Maria Werhly, 5th daughter, b.1793 Grindel, Solothurn; arrived 1819 Heureux Voyage; married Laurent Borer 03/07/1820 NF; 12 children. [p.302 — BORER (III), Johann b.01/08/1792 Erschwil — DISTINCT from our family:] Descendants use "Borer" surname; no proven kinship with Borer I or Borer II.
1 NOTE Archival reference: Henrique Bon (compiler), Imigrantes de Nova Friburgo — genealogias, pp.300–303. The compilation draws on Nova Friburgo parish registers, civil records, and the Fundação D. João VI archives. The six cited page images from the 2026-08-07 retrieval drop are archived in evidence/publications/ under this source id (see digital_file / additional_pages); the matching document-inventory entries remain to be added by the owner.
