1 NOTE Transcription: [Owner-supplied direct-ancestor roster, July 2026. Verbal/written family information consolidated from the project conversation; no scanned document exists. Content summarised below as recollected by Juan Carlos Muniz Armond.] Direct ancestors identified by the repository owner at project start (Ahnentafel positions 1–15): Position 1 — Juan Carlos Muniz Armond (self, living; b. Volta Redonda, RJ, 1982) Position 2 — [Father; living; name withheld — see P-0002] Position 3 — [Mother; living; name withheld — see P-0003] Position 4 — Geraldo Paz Armond (paternal grandfather; d. 1991, Volta Redonda) Position 5 — Cidália Engrácio Guimarães (paternal grandmother) Position 6 — [Maternal grandfather; name withheld — see P-0006] Position 7 — [Maternal grandmother; name withheld — see P-0007] Position 8 — Aristão Ferreira Armond (paternal great-grandfather; d. 1957, Volta Redonda) Position 9 — Eliza Balbina de Toledo (paternal great-grandmother) Position 10 — António Engrácio de Souza (maternal great-grandfather) Position 11 — Luzia Pinheiro da Conceição (maternal great-grandmother) Position 12 — [Maternal great-grandfather — see P-0012] Position 13 — [Maternal great-grandmother — see P-0013] Position 14 — [Maternal great-grandfather — see P-0014] Position 15 — [Maternal great-grandmother — see P-0015] [Names at positions 6–7 and 12–15 involve living or near-living persons and are withheld from this transcription; the structured person entities contain the appropriate privacy settings. Each assertion above requires independent civil or parish source corroboration — see individual person entities.]
